── (A) Stop one instance ──
$ apptainer instance stop hello-agent
  # → INFO: Stopping hello-agent instance of /path/to/sac-base.sif (PID=...)
$ sac agents stop hello-agent
  # → quit-turn sent; instance stopped; state files cleaned

── (B) Stop all (panic button) ──
$ apptainer instance stop --all
$ sac agents stop --all

── (C) Force-stop a wedged agent ──
$ sac agents stop hello-agent --force
  # → skips SDK quit-turn; SIGTERM straight to apptainer

── (D) Actually forget the agent (registry-level delete) ──
$ sac agents delete hello-agent -y
  # → removes ~/.scitex/agent-container/agents/hello-agent/ and runtime/hello-agent/
  # → spec.yaml in source dir is NOT touched
